Article 7 (Closing of Registration Record) The following registrations shall be made in the column for other matters, and upon such registration the relevant registration record shall be closed:
1. Registration of change made at the registry office having jurisdiction over the former place of administration of trust affairs where the place of administration of trust affairs is transferred to the jurisdiction of another registry office;
2. Registration of termination due to merger of a limited liability trust;
3. Registration of completion of liquidation.
